  "body": "Work package: https://openproject.romaine.life/wp/TMUX-21\n\nBumps fzt to v0.2.83, whose `DirProvider` treats a symlinked or junctioned folder as a folder. Before, the picker read one as a file, so a folder picker hid it; the work Mac's `/d` is a symlink, so `--start-dir /d/repos` could not get there. A new picker test covers a folders-only listing through a link and runs on the macOS CI job.\n\nThe fzt range also brings v0.2.79–82 (opt-in host-drawn query box, row-index lookups); nothing here turns those on.\n",
  "changed_files": 4,
  "closed_at": "2026-10-31T04:02:56Z",
